    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571650/extras/b7cf80173c123a8bf6e0abc0c954cb12.poster.avif?t=1701872529\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571650/extras/b7cf80173c123a8bf6e0abc0c954cb12.webm?t=1701872529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571650/extras/b7cf80173c123a8bf6e0abc0c954cb12.mp4?t=1701872529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Enter the World of Mutation Madness!</strong><br>Equip yourself with a powerful disinfectant gun and stand against hordes of mutant viruses to rescue Cell City from a devastating outbreak! Upgrade your weapon, unveil hidden secrets, and immerse yourself in non-stop action. Prepare for an epic battle of intensity and strategy!<br><br><strong>Thrilling Gameplay: </strong> As a skilled scientist armed with a disinfectant gun, navigate diverse levels and maps to eliminate waves of mutant viruses in exhilarating combos.<br><br><strong>Powerful Items:</strong> Use tactical in-game items like vaccines and antivirals to strategically enhance your gameplay and combat abilities.<br><br><strong>Weapon Upgrades:</strong> Enhance your arsenal by unlocking powerful upgrades for your disinfectant gun, allowing you to tackle tougher challenges with greater firepower.<br><br><strong>Mascot Companions: </strong> Team up with cute and fearless mascots to fight the virus and restore safety to the city!<br><br><strong>Special Modes:</strong> Engage in special game modes, including the thrilling Infinite Mode, where you'll face endless hordes of viruses, testing your skills and endurance to the limit.<br><br><strong>Virus Information:</strong> Unveil hidden secrets and gather crucial information about the virus outbreak as you progress, piecing together the mysteries behind the Madvirus.<br><br><strong>Hard Mode:</strong> Take on the outbreak's deadliest waves in Hard Difficulty mode. Prove your expertise as you battle mutating viruses on a whole new level.<br><br><strong>Achievements:</strong> Conquer levels, defeat foes, and accomplish special feats to earn a range of achievements. Demonstrate your mastery of the outbreak and earn well-deserved recognition.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571650/extras/b7cf80173c123a8bf6e0abc0c954cb12.poster.avif?t=1701872529\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571650/extras/b7cf80173c123a8bf6e0abc0c954cb12.webm?t=1701872529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571650/extras/b7cf80173c123a8bf6e0abc0c954cb12.mp4?t=1701872529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Enter the World of Mutation Madness!</strong><br>Equip yourself with a powerful disinfectant gun and stand against hordes of mutant viruses to rescue Cell City from a devastating outbreak! Upgrade your weapon, unveil hidden secrets, and immerse yourself in non-stop action. Prepare for an epic battle of intensity and strategy!<br><br><strong>Thrilling Gameplay: </strong> As a skilled scientist armed with a disinfectant gun, navigate diverse levels and maps to eliminate waves of mutant viruses in exhilarating combos.<br><br><strong>Powerful Items:</strong> Use tactical in-game items like vaccines and antivirals to strategically enhance your gameplay and combat abilities.<br><br><strong>Weapon Upgrades:</strong> Enhance your arsenal by unlocking powerful upgrades for your disinfectant gun, allowing you to tackle tougher challenges with greater firepower.<br><br><strong>Mascot Companions: </strong> Team up with cute and fearless mascots to fight the virus and restore safety to the city!<br><br><strong>Special Modes:</strong> Engage in special game modes, including the thrilling Infinite Mode, where you'll face endless hordes of viruses, testing your skills and endurance to the limit.<br><br><strong>Virus Information:</strong> Unveil hidden secrets and gather crucial information about the virus outbreak as you progress, piecing together the mysteries behind the Madvirus.<br><br><strong>Hard Mode:</strong> Take on the outbreak's deadliest waves in Hard Difficulty mode. Prove your expertise as you battle mutating viruses on a whole new level.<br><br><strong>Achievements:</strong> Conquer levels, defeat foes, and accomplish special feats to earn a range of achievements. Demonstrate your mastery of the outbreak and earn well-deserved recognition.",
    "short_description": "Welcome to the World of Mutation Madness, where chaos reigns, viruses evolve, and survival is the ultimate challenge!\ud83d\udca5Defeat waves of mutating viruses and save Cell City from the Madvirus outbreak!\ud83e\udda0\ud83d\udd2b Upgrade your gun and use powerful items, while discovering virus intel!\ud83e\uddea",
